---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Refund Policy — Shri Kundali">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 0">
    <h1 style="color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Shri Kundali sells a single digital product: a personalized Kundali PDF report, generated
      instantly and automatically from the birth details you provide. Because the report is
      created and delivered the moment you complete payment, there is no physical product,
      shipping, or waiting period involved.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">No Cancellations Once Generation Has Started</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Once your order is placed and payment is confirmed, report generation begins immediately.
      Because the report is a digital good that is consumed at the point of delivery, we are
      unable to accept cancellations or offer refunds after an order has been placed and
      generation has started — this includes cases where you change your mind, entered
      incorrect birth details, or are unhappy with the astrological content of the report.
    </p>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Please double-check your name, date of birth, time of birth and birthplace before
      submitting payment, as these directly determine the contents of your report.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">The Only Exception: Duplicate or Failed Payment</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      The one situation where a refund or resend applies is a technical payment error —
      for example, if you were charged more than once for the same order, or your payment
      was deducted but the report was never generated or delivered due to a technical fault
      on our end. In these cases we will either resend your report at no extra cost or refund
      the duplicate/failed charge in full.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">How to Request a Correction</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      If you believe you were affected by a duplicate or failed payment, email us at
      <a href="mailto:support@rashikundali.com" style="color:var(--color-primary)">support@rashikundali.com</a> within 7 days of your purchase with:
    </p>
    <ul style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li>Your name and email used for the purchase</li>
      <li>Payment ID or order ID</li>
      <li>A short description of the issue (e.g. charged twice, report never delivered)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Processing Time</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Verified duplicate/failed-payment refunds are processed within 5-7 business days and
      credited to the original payment method. You will receive a confirmation email once the
      refund or resend is initiated.
    </p>

    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);padding-top:1rem">
      Last updated: September 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
